Package: ggplot2.extended.companion
Title: ggplot2 Extended Companion
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Antti", "Rask", , "antti@youcanbeapirate.com", role = c("cre", "aut"))
Description: A searchable, filterable directory of ggplot2 extension packages
    with daily-refreshed metadata, download statistics, and pre-rendered code
    examples. Built as a Shiny app using the golem framework.
